From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 17:45:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rename invoice Payment Instructions to Notes, add Bill To
 phone field, fix CSS-escaping bug in print footer

- "Payment Instructions" label on the invoice/proposal editor is now "Notes"
- Added a Phone field to the invoice "Bill To" section (saved, printed, and
  wired through invoiceData.js as bill_to_phone)
- Fixed the printed invoice/proposal footer showing a literal "&amp;" instead
  of "&" in business names - it was being run through the HTML escaper
  instead of a CSS-string escaper for the CSS content: "..." print footer

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017BmuYvXDS789rX5NPdnUT6
